        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neck pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "5–6 days of constant dull ache in the right posterior neck/upper shoulder, 4–5/10, with a sharp twinge when turning the head right or reversing the car. Insidious onset after a long day at a computer, possibly related to a new chair or sleeping awkwardly. Worse at the end of the day and better in the morning and with a hot shower."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neck movement on telehealth functional screen"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right rotation reduced due to pain. Flexion and extension okay but 'pulls a bit'."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Upper limb function and neurological symptoms reported on telehealth screen"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Can lift arms above head, grip, type, and carry shopping. No dermatomal numbness or shooting arm pain reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
