        },
        "valueString": "Screen negative: no trauma; arm pain, radicular symptoms, paraesthesia, or weakness; headache, visual symptoms, dizziness, or facial symptoms; chest pain, shortness of breath, or jaw/arm pain; fever, weight loss, night sweats, or recent infection; bowel/bladder change, gait issue, or fine motor clumsiness. No history of malignancy, inflammatory arthritis, or osteoporosis."
      }
